### Financial Analyst Permission Tests
### Use this file with REST Client extension in VS Code

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@financialAnalystNationalCode = 1718933002
@financialAnalystPassword = password

### 1. Login as Financial Analyst
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nationalCode": "{{financialAnalystNationalCode}}",
  "password": "{{financialAnalystPassword}}"
}

### Extract token from login response
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 2. Test: View Person Info (Should PASS - has view_person_info permission)
GET {{baseUrl}}/persons/by-national-code/1234567890
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Test: View Vehicle Info (Should PASS - has view_vehicle_info permission)
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles/by-tracking/TRACK001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Test: View Payments (Should PASS - has view_payments permission)
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/offline
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Test: View Request Details (Should PASS - has multiple view permissions)
GET {{baseUrl}}/request/by-tracking/TRACK001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Test: Create Offline Payment (Should PASS - has edit permission for payments)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/offline
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "RequestID": 1,
  "Amount": 100000,
  "PaymentDate": "2025-10-19",
  "ReceiptNumber": "REC-001",
  "Description": "تست پرداخت آفلاین"
}

### 7. Test: View My Tasks (Should PASS - authenticated user)
GET {{baseUrl}}/approvals/my-tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Test: Approve/Reject Request (Should PASS - has approve_request permission)
POST {{baseUrl}}/approvals/1/decision
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "approved",
  "comment": "پرداخت تایید شد"
}

### 9. Test: Edit Person Info (Should FAIL - only has view, not edit permission)
POST {{baseUrl}}/persons/upsert
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "NationalCode": "1234567890",
  "FullName": "تست",
  "FatherName": "تست"
}

### 10. Test: View Workflow Request Details (Should PASS - has view permissions)
GET {{baseUrl}}/workflow/requests/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Test: Make Workflow Decision (Should PASS - has approve/reject permissions)
POST {{baseUrl}}/workflow/steps/1/decision
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "approved",
  "comment": "تایید شد"
}

### 12. Test: Upload Payment Receipt (Should FAIL - needs view_payment_documents edit permission)
# Note: Financial analyst only has VIEW permission for documents, not EDIT
POST {{baseUrl}}/uploads/receipt
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="receipt.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test-receipt.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 13. Test: Access Without Token (Should FAIL - 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/offline

### Summary of Expected Results:
# Tests 2-8, 10-11: Should return 200 OK (Permission granted)
# Test 9: Should return 403 Forbidden (No edit permission for persons)
# Test 12: Should return 403 Forbidden (No edit permission for payment documents)
# Test 13: Should return 401 Unauthorized (No token provided)
